<title>USA: Mercantile Bancorp Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Mercantile Bancorp Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.09		    $0.89</p>
<p> Net			 66,630		   56,592</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  61,024		   63,028</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding merger related expenses, Q4 1996 net income was $75.1 million or $1.23 a share.  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.10		    $3.74</p>
<p> Net			191,947		  232,676</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  61,875		   61,884</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for 12 months ended December 31, 1996 excluding acquisition charges and one-time SAIF charge was $248.49 million or $4.01 a share.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
